Purgatorios wrote:
> 
> Should I use my (probable) wish from the blessed magic lamp or wait
> longer to see if I will need it?  If so, on what?

I'd keep the lamp for perma light. Use it only if you need something
very important that you cannot get from a different source. (Blessed
magic lamps have only a 80% chance of granting a wish.)

> Should I use excalibur or grayswandir?

Both are fine. Enchant them to +5 and once more, if possible.

> Should I spend my scrolls of enchant weapon/armor, magic marker etc.
> or wait until I get better stuff?

Spend enchant armor on your primary weapon of choice; if you have a
lot of scrolls enchant Grayswandir to max for Gehennom. In the early
and mid game Excalibur might be more advantageous; but you seem to
have proceded quite far already?

> What should I genocide?

Blessed genocide L's and h's (as long as you're not playing a dwarf).
I also genocide minotaurs quite often if I'm playing weak characters.

> Since I have polycontrol and polymorph should I try to eat rings or
> something crazy like that?

I don't, but if you like and have some spare rings. I seem to recall
that you are not guaranteed an intrinsic from eating a ring, so you
should have a couple. Generally, WRT the "ordinary" intrinsics, I'd
try to get the intrinsics from eating monsters, though; much simpler.

> Magic trap dancing and then succubus wrasslin'?

For magic trap dancing you should be fire resistant and buff enough.
I wouldn't do foo'cubus dancing, but others do.

Have fun!

